<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Akolinto</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua Nnongoi ya Pauli kwa Akolinto</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Akolinto</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Kol</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 Akolinto</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua Nnongoi ya Pauli kwa Akolinto</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1"/>Balua yi' iandikilwe na nenga na Pauli kwo yangatiyana na nnongo witu Sositene. Naakemilwe panga na ntumilwe wa Yesu Kilisitu bu'kana na mwabini mwene Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1CO 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2"/>Tumwandikyanga mwenga mwamubile mwa likanisa lya Nnu'ngu' lya Kolinto, mwamupeleteyilwe kwo lu'mbana kwinu na Kilisitu Yesu. Ngamukemelwa mube mwapeleteu bake Nnu'ngu' pamope na bandu boti babalitambwa lina lya Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu, ywembe nga Bwana wabe na Bwana witu.<verse eid="1CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3"/>Ngu'ngu' na amani yaibu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' Tati' bitu na kwa Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu, ibe pamope na mwe.<verse eid="1CO 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwayalya Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4"/>Ninsukulu Nnu'ngu' wangu' masu'ba goti kwinu mwenga, kwa kitumbu sa ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu' yamupeyilwe kwa ndi'la ya Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5"/>Kwa kitumbu so lu'mbana na Kilisitu, muyaliwite muulongeli woti na muutangi woti, <verse eid="1CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6"/>kwa mwanjaa ukong'ondeli watunnetile nkati yinu bu'kana na Kilisitu ulaya ukakape. <verse eid="1CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7"/>Kwa nyo, mupu'ngu'kilweli na upo yoyoti ya kiloo pamuli'nda kwa kilu'lu' bonekana kwa Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8"/>Ywembe aalu'a kumpanga mukangamale mpaka kuundi'la, li'nga kane mube na makosa lisu'ba li'lu' lyoisa kwake Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9"/>Nnu'ngu' ywau'bi'li'ka ngaywaankemite mwenga mutame mukiselele pamope na Mwana wake Yesu Kilisitu Bwana witu.<verse eid="1CO 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baganika kwa aumini mulikanisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10"/>Mwalongo bangu', nendakunnu'banga kwa lina lya Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu mwaboti muyi'ki'tyane, kanekube na mayu'mano pakati yinu, na muganiye pamope kwa galu' gamugabinia. <verse eid="1CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11"/>Kwa mwanjaa nibakiyilwe na bandu ba munyumba ya Kloe panga kubile na mayu'mano pakati yinu. <verse eid="1CO 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12"/>Bai, pano nilombolya panga kila mundu wa kasinu alongela lya kisake, yumo abaya, “Nenga na ywa Pauli,” ywi'ngi', “Nenga na ywa Apolo,” ywi'ngi', “Nenga na ywa Petili,” na ywi'ngi', “Nenga na ywa Kilisitu.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13"/>Buli, Kilisitu aatibaganika? Buli, Pauli aabambilwe kwa kitumbu sinu? Au mwaabatisilwe kwa lina lya Pauli? <verse eid="1CO 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14"/>Ninsukulu Nnu'ngu' kwa mwanjaa nimmatisikeli mundu ywoywoti kasinu ila Kilisipo na Gayo, <verse eid="1CO 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15"/>Kwa nyo, ntu'pu' ywawesa baya panga abatisilwe kwa lina lyangu'. <verse eid="1CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16"/>(Lakini niku'mbu'kile panga, naabatisike na bandu ba munyumba ya Stefana, bu'ka pa bo nitangiteli panga naammatisike na mundu ywi'ngi'.) <verse eid="1CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17"/>Kwa mwanjaa, Kilisitu aanitumikeli li'nga nibatise, ila niale Abali Inannoga, kai' niale pangali u'bi'lya ikima ya bandu, li'nga kiwo sa Kilisitu munsalaba sakane obeya makakala gake.<verse eid="1CO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kilisitu nga makakala na ikima ya Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18"/>Kwa mwanjaa maalo ga kiwo sa Yesu munsalaba kwa balu' babaoba baibona ulogeloge bai, lakini kwitu twenga twatukosopolelwa, galaya makakala ga Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19"/>Kwa mwanjaa maandiko mapeleteu gabaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">“Naialabiya ikima yabe bene ikima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">na kugataikwa malango ga bene malango.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20"/>Bai, tubaye buli bu'kana na bene ikima, balimu ba Salya ya Musa, au alongeli ba masu'ba gano? Nnu'ngu' alayite panga ikima ya dunia yi'no ulogeloge bai.<verse eid="1CO 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21"/>Nnu'ngu' mu ikima yake, aabini kwakosopolya balu' babau'bi'lya kwa ndi'la ya maalo gatuala, gagabonekana kwabe panga ga kilogeloge. Aapangite nyalu' kwa mwanjaa kwa ndi'la ya ikima ya kimundu, bandu baakombwili kuntanga Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22"/>Ayahudi bapala mwanju li'nga bau'bi'li, na Ayunani bapala ikima. <verse eid="1CO 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23"/>Lakini twenga tuala abali ya Kilisitu ywabambilwe munsalaba, likowe li' kwa Ayahudi kiku'balo na kwa Ayunani ibonekana ulalo. <verse eid="1CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24"/>Lakini kwa balu' babakemilwe na Nnu'ngu', babe Ayahudi au Ayunani, Kilisitu nga makakala ga Nnu'ngu' na kai' nga ikima ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1CO 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25"/>Kwa mwanjaa sakibonekana na bandu panga ulogeloge, kwa Nnu'ngu' kibile na ikima kulikoni ikima ya bandu, na ukigopi wa Nnu'ngu' ubile na makakala kulikoni makakala ga bandu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26"/>Mwalongo, muku'mbu'ki pamwakemilwe na Nnu'ngu'. Kwa kili'ngo sa kimundu mwabamboneli mwamwaabile na ikima, makakala, wala mubelekwili mumisengo yene yeo, wala yo isimika. <verse eid="1CO 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27"/>Lakini Nnu'ngu' aaisawi ikowe ya kilogeloge ya mudunia yi'no li'nga kwapeya oni bene ikima, kai', Nnu'ngu' aaisawi ikowe ya ukigopi ya mudunia yi'no li'nga kwapeya oni bene makakala. <verse eid="1CO 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28"/>Nnu'ngu' aaisawi ikowe yangaliisimilwa na yaisalaulilwa mudunia yi'no, ikowe yangali maana, li'nga aialabiye ikowe yabaibona ya maana. <verse eid="1CO 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29"/>Aapangite nyo li'nga kaneabe mundu ywakwipuna nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1CO 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30"/>Lakini Nnu'ngu' annu'mbaniye na Kilisitu Yesu na kumpanga ikima yitu bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu'. Kwa ndi'la ya Kilisitu tubalangilwa aki kwa Nnu'ngu' no pangilwa twapeleteu ba Nnu'ngu', no kosopolelwa bu'ka mumasambi gitu. <verse eid="1CO 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31"/>Kati mu'lu' mwagabaite Maandiko Mapeleteu panga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:31">“Ywapala kwipuna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:31">aipune kwa kitumbu sa Bwana.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2"/>
  <para style="s">Liyi'gi'yo bu'kana na Yesu ywabambilwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1"/>Mwalongo bangu', panaaisi kasinu kumwalya iyo ya liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu', naisi lili kwa ung'anga wo longela au kwo tumya ikima ya dunia yi'no. <verse eid="1CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2"/>Kwa mwanjaa panaabile kasinu naabini kanenilitange likowe li'ngi', ila abali ya Yesu Kilisitu ywabambilwe munsalaba bai. <verse eid="1CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3"/>Panaabile kasinu naabi na kigopi, kaniyogopa no lendema muno. <verse eid="1CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4"/>Mayi'gano na maalo gangu' gaapiyilweli kwa mayi'gi'yo ga kwauta bandu, au ikima, ila galayage uweso wa Loo wa Nnu'ngu', <verse eid="1CO 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5"/>li'nga imani yinu yaakanesengelwa muikima ya kimundu, ila mumakakala ga Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="1CO 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ikima ya Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6"/>Ata nyo twenga tulongela kwa ikima kwa balu' babakomile loo yabe, lakini ikima yo ya pano padunia yi'noli, wala ya akulungwa ba dunia yi'no ya bababile mulikundi lyo oba. <verse eid="1CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7"/>Ila twenga tulongela ikima ya Nnu'ngu' yembe nga iyo yaiyilwe na Nnu'ngu' yayaabi'kilwe wiso kubile balo ata umbilwa kwa dunia kwa kitumbu sa utukupu witu. <verse eid="1CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8"/>Ntu'pu' ata nkulungwa yumo ywa mudunia yi'no ywaaitangite ikima yi'. Kenda bakaitanga ikima yo, balu'e kummambali munsalaba Bwana wa utukupu. <verse eid="1CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9"/>Lakini kati mu'lu' mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu panga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">“Makowe gangali bonekana na liyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">ata lisikilo linagayu'wali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">makowe gangali ganiyilwa na mundu ywoywoti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">ago nga galu' Nnu'ngu' aabi'ki wiso babampenda.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10"/>Lakini Nnu'ngu' aatuumukuli twenga iyo yi'lu' kwa ndi'la ya Loo wake, kwa mwanjaa Loo apekeseni ili'be yoti, ata makowe ga nkati muno ga Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11"/>Nyai ywatanga gawasa mundu ywi'ngi' ila loo ya mwene mundu yaibile nkati yake? Nyinyonyo, ntu'pu' ywatanga gawasa Nnu'ngu', ila Loo wa mwene Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1CO 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12"/>Kwa nyo, twenga tupokili loo wa padunia, ila tupoki Loo ywabu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' li'nga tupate kugatanga galu' gatuyali Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="1CO 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13"/>Bai, twenga tulongelali kwa mayi'gi'yo gatuyi'ganilwe kwa ikima ya kimundu, ila gatuyi'ganilwe na Loo mpeleteu. Tugalongela mayi'gi'yo ga kiloo kwa bandu bababile na aywo Loo. <verse eid="1CO 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14"/>Mundu wa dunia apokyali makowe ga Loo wa Nnu'ngu' kwa mwanjaa kwake ywembe makowe go ga kilalo bai. Malango gake gawesali kwipwa makowe go, ila gawesa kwipulwa kwo yangatiyilwa na Loo bai. <verse eid="1CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15"/>Lakini mundu ywatawalilwa na Loo wa Nnu'ngu' awesa kuukwipwa ukakape wa kila kili'be, lakini ywembe aukumilwali na mundu ywoywoti. <verse eid="1CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16"/>Kati mwagabaya maandiko, “Nyai ywatangite mwawasa Bwana li'nga apate kunnyi'gana?” Lakini twenga tuwasa kati mwawasa Kilisitu.<verse eid="1CO 2:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3"/>
  <para style="s">Umope mulyengo lya Bwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1"/>Kakape mwalongo bangu', niwesiteli longela na mwenga kati mwabandu mwamutawalilwa na Loo wa Nnu'ngu', ila kati mwabandu mwamutawalilwa na makowe ga mudunia. Mukabalo mwabana ilekeleke mumaisa ga Kikilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2"/>Nanki'ngiye mabele wala nannyakiyeli kilyo kinonopau. Naapangite nyo kwa mwanjaa mwaai munaikali po lya kilyo so. Eloo, ata nambi'yambi' mukiwesali. <verse eid="1CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3"/>Mwenga ata nambi'yambi' mwabandu ba iyendo ya payi'ga, kwa mwanjaa kasinu kubile na bwigu no pitiniana, ago galaya panga mwenga mwabandu ba mudunia, kai' iyendo yinu ya bandu ba payi'ga. <verse eid="1CO 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4"/>Kwa mwanjaa yumo ywinu pabaya, “Nenga na ywa Pauli,” na ywi'ngi', “Nenga na ywa Apolo,” buli! Ago galayali panga mwenga mukabalo panga kati mwabapanga bandu ba dunia yi'no?<verse eid="1CO 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5"/>Bai, Apolo nga nyai? Na Pauli nga nyai? Twenga twaboti twatumisi li'nga kunnaya mwenga ndi'la ya u'bi'lya. Kila yumo ywitu apanga lyengo lyapeyilwe na Bwana. <verse eid="1CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6"/>Nenga naapandike mbeyu, Apolo ngaiyitya masi', lakini Nnu'ngu' ngaywaipangite iku'le. <verse eid="1CO 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7"/>Kwa nyo, ywapandike na ywayiti masi' boti kili'be lili, ila ywangama Nnu'ngu' ywaipangite iku'le. <verse eid="1CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8"/>Yu'lu' ywapandike na ywayiti masi', boti balekineli, lakini kila mundu aapokya upo yake bu'kana no kasana kwake mwene. <verse eid="1CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9"/>Twenga twabi'li' tupangite kiyangatani na Nnu'ngu' mulyengo lyake, na Likanisa nga lyengo lya Nnu'ngu'. Kai', mwenga mwa nyumba yake.<verse eid="1CO 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10"/>Kwo bu'kana na ngu'ngu' yanipeyilwe na Nnu'ngu' nipange kati nansengi nku'lu' mwene ikima, naabi'i nsingi. Nambi'yambi' mundu ywi'ngi' asenga panani yangu'. Lakini yendapwaika panga kila mundu alinguli wiso mu'lu' mwasenga panani yake. <verse eid="1CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11"/>Kwa mwanjaa ntu'pu' mundu ywoywoti ywawesa bi'ka nsingi wi'ngi' ila wu'lu' waubi'kilwe, nawembe nga Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12"/>Lakini mana mundu asengite panani ya nsingi wo kwa zaabu au madini ga mbanje au maliwe ga samani au mikongo au manyei au kipelei, <verse eid="1CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13"/>lyengo lya kila mundu lyabonekana pangali iya lisu'ba li'lu' lya ukumu. Kwa mwanjaa lisu'ba li'lu' lyapitya pakati ya mwoto, na mwoto wu'lu' ngawalu'a li'nga no laya mwalibile lyengo lya kila mundu. <verse eid="1CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14"/>Manaitei sasengite mundu saigala, mundu ywo aapokya upo yake bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu', <verse eid="1CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15"/>lakini mana si'lu' sasengite satinika, ywembe aapatali upo. Ata nyo mwene aakosopolelwa, kati mundu ywalopolilwe bu'ka pamwoto.<verse eid="1CO 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16"/>Buli, mutangiteli panga mwenga mwa nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' na Loo wa Nnu'ngu' atama nkati yinu? <verse eid="1CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17"/>Bai, mundu mana asengwaniye nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', Nnu'ngu' aalu'a kunnangamisa nyinyonyo. Kwa mwanjaa nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' mbeletau, na mwenga nga mwanyumba yake.<verse eid="1CO 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18"/>Mundu ywoywoti pakati yinu kaneaikonge mwene panga abile na ikima. Mana mundu kaaibona abile na ikima ya mudunia yi'no, aipange nnalo li'nga apate baa na ikima ya kweli. <verse eid="1CO 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19"/>Nilongela nnya kwa mwanjaa ikima ya dunia yi'no kwa Nnu'ngu' ibonekana ulalo bai. Kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu panga, “Nnu'ngu' aayonja bene ikima muung'anga wabe bene.” <verse eid="1CO 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20"/>Kai' gabaya, “Bwana Nnu'ngu' agatangite mawaso ga bene ikima panga, gapwaikali.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21"/>Kwa nyo, mundu kaneaipuni bandu kwa mwanjaa kila kili'be nga sinu. <verse eid="1CO 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22"/>Apange Pauli, abe Apolo, au Petili. Ibe ya mudunia yi'no, au ukoto, au kiwo, ibe yaibile nambi'yambi', au yayalu'a isa, yoti nga yinu. <verse eid="1CO 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23"/>Mwenga mwa ba Kilisitu, na Kilisitu ywa Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="1CO 3:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4"/>
  <para style="s">Utumisi wa atumilwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1"/>Bai, bandu batubalangili panga twenga twaatumisi ba Kilisitu tukamukiyilwe lyengo lyo aala abali ya Nnu'ngu' yayaiyilwe. <verse eid="1CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2"/>Apo, sakipalikwa kwa mundu ywoywoti ywakamukiyilwe lyengo lyo, au'bi'li'ke. <verse eid="1CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3"/>Lakini kwangu' nenga ukumilwa na mwenga wala na mankama ya bandu, kili'be li. Kai' ata namwene niiukumuli. <verse eid="1CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4"/>Kwa mwanjaa nikibonali kitumbu sa kwiukumu namwene, lakini kwo baya nyo, nilombolyali panga nenga ntu'pu' likosa. Ywaniukumu nenga mwene Bwana. <verse eid="1CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5"/>Kwa nyo, mwenga kanemuukumu kubile balo timya nsimu wake. Muli'nde mpaka lisu'ba lyaaisa Bwana Yesu. Ywembe ngaalu'a kwimulika ili'be yoti yaiyilwe mulubi'ndu' no laya mabinio ga myoyo ya bandu. Nsimu wo, kila nkilisitu aapokya liposo lyabile nalyo bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="1CO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6"/>Mwalongo bangu', makowe goti ganilongei gabu'kana na nenga na Apolo, yaai li'nga mwiyi'gane mayi'gi'yo gagabaya, “Kanemwu'mbe gagaandikilwe mu Maandiko Mapeleteu.” Mana mwaubi'ngi'ya nnongelo wo, aalu'a bonekanali mundu ywaalu'a kwipunia mundu yumo na kummawa ywi'ngi'. <verse eid="1CO 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7"/>Tumbwelelo, nyai ywakupangite wenga ube wa mundu wo pwaika muno kulikoni bi'ngi'? Ki'li'gani saubile naso sangalipeyelwa na Nnu'ngu'? Manaitei mutepeyelwa, mwanjaa namani mwilumba kati mupatike kwa makakala ginu mwabene?<verse eid="1CO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8"/>Mwiwasilya panga muyomwike pata kila kikowe samukipala! Au muyomwike tayilika no pangika mwakulungwa pangali twenga! Ilu'e panga male mukapangilwa mwakulungwa kwa mwanjaa tulu'e baa twaakulungwa pamope na mwenga. <verse eid="1CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9"/>Lakini nibona panga Nnu'ngu' atupangite twatumilwe tube twabandu ba kuundi'la kati atabilwe babaukumilwe kiwo. Tuyi'mi'kilwe munsisingwa wa tabulu li'nga tupange mandi'ya kwa dunia yoti itubone, kwenda kwa bandu bai lili, lakini na ata malaika. <verse eid="1CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10"/>Kwa kitumbu sa kuntumikiya Kilisitu, bandu batubona twenga twalalo, lakini mwenga mwibona mwabene ikima kwa kitumbu sa kummi'ngi'ya Kilisitu. Twenga tubonekana twakikigopi, lakini mwenga mwibona mubile na makakala. Mwenga mwibona panga mwendaisimika, lakini twenga twendasalaulilwa. <verse eid="1CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11"/>Mpaka nambi'yambi'no, twenga ntu'pu' kilyo na tubile na nnyota na buula. Mala yambone twendaku'mbu'lwa na ntu'pu' potamo. <verse eid="1CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12"/>Tupanga kasi kwo kasana kwa maboko gitu. Bandu pabatutukana, tunnu'ba Nnu'ngu' aayali. Bandu pabatupangya maakau, twendakwakomeya. <verse eid="1CO 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13"/>Bandu pabatuku'pi'ki'ya, twayangwa kwo tu'lya, lakini bandu bayendelya kutupanga kati undi ya padunia na kwa kila mundu, twenga twasapu.<verse eid="1CO 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14"/>Nimmakiyanga ga kwa kitumbu sa kumpeyanga oni lili, ila kunkwi'li'ka kati mwabana bangu' banaapenda. <verse eid="1CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15"/>Pamope no panga mubile na balimu maku'mi elupu mu Kilisitu, lakini mubileli na tati' bambone. Kwo pi'tya Abali Inannoga, nenga naapangike na tati' kasinu kwa Kilisitu Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16"/>Kwa nyo, nendakunkong'ondelya muno panga muyige mwanipanga nenga. <verse eid="1CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17"/>Alyo ngalyalinipangite nintume Timoteo kasinu, ywembe mwana wangu' ywanimpendile na ywau'bi'li'ka mulyengo lya Bwana. Ywembe aalu'a kunku'mbu'ki'ya mu'lu' mwanibi'ngi'ya nenga kwo lu'mbana na Kilisitu na mwaniyi'gana bandu kila pandu mumakanisa goti.<verse eid="1CO 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18"/>Bi'ngi' binu bendakwipuna kabawasilya panga naaisali kuntyangilya kai'. <verse eid="1CO 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19"/>Lakini mana Bwana apendile naaisa kasinu kiyu'ngu'ya, kwenda nitange makowe gabalongela abo babaipuna baili, ila no tanga makakala gabe. <verse eid="1CO 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20"/>Kwa mwanjaa ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' ubonekanali kwa mayi'gi'yo bai, ila na kwa makakala. <verse eid="1CO 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21"/>Mwenga mubaye mwabene, buli, niise kasinu kwa mapimbo, au niise kwa loo ya upendo na kwo liya?<verse eid="1CO 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5"/>
  <para style="s">Upege mumakanisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1"/>Nipendili kugau'bi'lya makowe gagayu'wanika panga, pakati yinu kubile na upege. Upege kati wo unabonekanali ata kwa bandu bangali kuntanga Nnu'ngu', panga mundu atyangite na nnyumbo wa tati' bake. <verse eid="1CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2"/>Mwenga mwendakwipuna! Mwapalikwe mulombole na kummi'nga mukipi'nga sinu mundu ywapangite ulau wo! <verse eid="1CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3"/>Pamope no panga nibile kuutalu na mwenga, lakini tubile pamope kwa ndi'la ya loo. Na niyomwike kumuukumu mundu ywo kati namundu nanibile pamope namwenga. <verse eid="1CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4"/>Pamukongolekana pamope kwa lina lya Bwana Yesu, nanenga nibile pamope na mwenga kwa loo, na uweso wa Bwana Yesu ubile pakati yinu. <verse eid="1CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5"/>Apo, mundu ywo mummu'ye kasinu na kunneka muutawala wa Ibilisi li'nga bwu'mi wake walabike, na loo yake yaakosopolelwe lisu'ba lyo buyangana kwa Bwana Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6"/>Kwipuna kwinu kupwaikali. Buli, mutangiteli panga ngelule njene bai iwesa kuulu'ya bwembe woti? <verse eid="1CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7"/>Mubu'ye ngelule ya masambi ga kwai'mbu' mu bwembe wawinyatilwe, apo mwaapanga mwabandu baayambi' kati bwembe wawinyatilwe wangali ngelule, kwa mwanjaa Kilisitu mwana ngondolo witu wa Pasika ayomwike piyilwa panga salaka. <verse eid="1CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8"/>Kwa nyo, tupange kalamu yitu pangali tumya likati lyene ngelule ya kwai'mbu', yaani ya mabinio maakau na ulau. Ila tutumi makati gangalu'la, kwo lombolya mabinio ganannoga na ukakape.<verse eid="1CO 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9"/>Naamwandiki mubalua yangu' panga kanemupange kiselele na bandu apege. <verse eid="1CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10"/>Apo nilombolyali panga kanemuyangatiyane na bandu ba dunia yi'no, kwa mwanjaa mulu'e palikwa ama mudunia yi'no li'nga mube kuutalu na apege, au asoyo na apokonyoli, au babakilikitya inyago. <verse eid="1CO 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11"/>Pano nilombolya panga, kanemupange kiselele na mundu yu'lu' ywaibaya panga Nkilisitu ku'no kayendelya na upege, usoyo, kilikitya inyago, ntukani, nnobyawi'mbi' au mpokonyoli. Mundu kati ywo kanemuyi'ki'ti ata lya nakwe.<verse eid="1CO 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12"/>Bai, lyengo lyangu' lili kwaukumu bababile panja ya kipi'nga sa aumini. Mupalikwa kwaukumu bababile mukipi'nga sinu. <verse eid="1CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13"/>Nnu'ngu' aalu'a kwaukumu abo bababile panja. Maandiko gabaya, “Mwenga mummu'ye aywo mundu nnau pakati yinu.”<verse eid="1CO 5:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6"/>
  <para style="s">Sitakyana kwa alongo ba muimani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1"/>Manaitei pakati yinu kubile na mundu mwene mwalo na nnyine, mwanjaa namani apeleka mwalo wake kwa bandu bangali aumini paali pa kumpeleka kwa apeleteu ba Nnu'ngu'? <verse eid="1CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2"/>Au mutangiteli panga apeleteu ngabaalu'a kwiukumu dunia? Manaitei dunia yaukumilwa na mwenga, mwanjaa namani mukotoka ukumyana ata kwa makowe masini? <verse eid="1CO 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3"/>Mwenga mutangiteli panga twalu'a kwaukumu ata malaika? Bai, mwenga muwesa ukumu makowe ga maisa gano. <verse eid="1CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4"/>Tumbwelelo, pamugongwana kwa makowe ginu ga kila lisu'ba, mwanjaa namani mupeleka myalo yinu kwa bandu ba panja ya kanisa? <verse eid="1CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5"/>Nilongela nnya linga mwiibone oni. Ngatubaye panga kwinu mwenga ntu'pu' mundu mwene ikima ywawesa ukumu myalo ya aumini? <verse eid="1CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6"/>Lakini mwenga mubile na kitibe sa mundu kunsitakya mumini nnyine kumankama, kwa bandu bangali aumini!<verse eid="1CO 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7"/>Akwo sitakyana kwinu mwabene na bene kulaya panga muyomwike sindwa. Yaai male kwinu mwenga komeya galu' gangali aki, ata ikatei pokonyolwa ili'be yinu. <verse eid="1CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8"/>Lakini mwenga nga mwamupanga maakau no pokonywa mali ya bandu bi'ngi', na bamwapangya ga alongo binu aumini. <verse eid="1CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9"/>Au mutangiteli panga alau baaulisili ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu'? Kanemwikonge! Apege, babaikilikitya inyago, babaileka ndoa no yenda panja, apege ba analu'me sika, <verse eid="1CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10"/>baii, asoyo, alobyawi'mbi', atukani, wala apokonyoli baaulisili ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1CO 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11"/>Mwabi'ngi' binu mwabile kati bo. Lakini mwatigu'lu'li'lwa, mwatipeleteyelwa, mwabalangililwe aki kwa lina lya Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu na kwa Loo wa Nnu'ngu' witu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mutumi yi'ga yinu kwa utukupu wa Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12"/>Mundu awesa baya, “Kwangu' nenga ili'be yoti yendayi'ki'ti'lwa.” Eloo, lakini kwinu mwenga ili'be yoti yo pwaika lili. Niwesa baya panga, “Ili'be yoti yendayi'ki'ti'lwa kwangu' nenga,” lakini naayi'ki'tya lili panga nitawalilwe na kili'be sosoti. <verse eid="1CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13"/>“Kilyo kwa ndumbo na ndumbo kwa kilyo. Lakini Nnu'ngu' aalu'a kwilangamisa yoti ibi'li'.” Yi'ga iumbilweli kwa kitumbu sa upege ila kwa kitumbu sa kuntumikia Bwana na Bwana kwa kwikota yi'ga. <verse eid="1CO 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14"/>Nnu'ngu' ywannyu'yite Bwana Yesu bu'ka kuuwi'li aalu'a kutuyu'ya na twenga kwa uweso wake.<verse eid="1CO 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15"/>Buli, mutangiteli panga yi'ga yinu nga ili'mbi'li'mbi' ya yi'ga ya Kilisitu? Buli, nitole ili'mbi'li'mbi' ya yi'ga ya Kilisitu na kwilu'mbaniya na yi'ga ya mpege? Ipwaikali ata pasene! <verse eid="1CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16"/>Au mutangiteli panga mundu ywoywoti ywapanga kiyangatani na mpege apanga yi'ga yimo na ywembe? Ayi' nga kati mu'lu' mwaiandikilwe mu Maandiko Mapeleteu panga, “Abi'li' bo, baapanga yi'ga yimo.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17"/>Lakini ywoywoti ywalu'mbana na Bwana endagalambuka no baa na loo yimo na ywembe. <verse eid="1CO 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18"/>Kwa nyo muutile upege, kwa mwanjaa sambi yi'ngi' yoti yaipanga mundu, aipanga panja ya yi'ga yake, lakini yu'lu' ywapanga upege, apanga sambi nkati ya yi'ga yake mwene. <verse eid="1CO 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19"/>Au mutangiteli panga yi'ga yinu nga nyumba ya Loo Mpeleteu ywabile nkati yinu ywamupeyilwe na Nnu'ngu'? Namwenga mwa mali yinu mwabeneli. <verse eid="1CO 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20"/>Mwanjaa, Nnu'ngu' aampi'mite kwa bei. Kwa nnyo, yi'ga yinu inkwi'ye Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="1CO 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7"/>
  <para style="s">Likowe bu'kana no kobeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1"/>Bai, bu'kana na makowe galu' gamwaaniandikile, “Nantali nnalu'me kaneakobeke,” <verse eid="1CO 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2"/>lakini li'nga kuuyepa upege, bai, kila nnalu'me abe na nnyumbowe na nnwawa abe na nsengowe. <verse eid="1CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3"/>Nnalu'me apalikwa ampangi nnyumbowe goti gagapalikwa mulisengele, nyinyonyo na nnwawa kwa nsengowe. <verse eid="1CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4"/>Nnwawa nku'nda ntu'pu' utawala kwa yi'ga yake, ila kwa nsengowe, nyinyonyo na kwa nnalu'me ywakobike. <verse eid="1CO 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5"/>Kanemuyimane, ila mupange kwo yi'ki'tyana panga kwa wakati nsene bai, li'nga mupate lipala lya kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu'. Bu'kapo muki'li'bu'kyane kai', li'nga Ibilisi aakane pata lipala lya kumpaya kwo kotoka li'ngi'lya mumakowe ginu.<verse eid="1CO 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6"/>Makowe gano ganimmakia kwenda amuli lili, ila ninnyi'ki'tiye mulekangane kwa wakati nsene bai. <verse eid="1CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7"/>Naapendi kila mundu abe kati mwanibile nenga, lakini ibileli nyo kwa mwanjaa kila mundu Nnu'ngu' ampei uweso wa kisake, aapangite ywi'ngi' apange nya, na ywi'ngi' nyalu'.<verse eid="1CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8"/>Lakini naabakia balu' bangali kobeka na alwawa awi'li'kwa panga yaali'ngani batame ulu'mi'langa kati mwanibile nenga. <verse eid="1CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9"/>Lakini mana bakombwali kwikanikiya bene, nantali bakobeke no ku'nda kulikoni tama na maminyikio ga payi'ga.<verse eid="1CO 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10"/>Kwa balu' babayomwike kobekana, Nnu'ngu' aapeya amuli, kwenda nengali panga, nwawa nku'nda kanealekangane na nsengowe. <verse eid="1CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11"/>Lakini mana alekangine nakwe, bai apalikwa atame pangali ku'nda, au aawane na nsengowe li'nga baki'li'bu'kyane, nyinyonyo na nnalu'me nkobeka kanealekane na nnyumbowe.<verse eid="1CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12"/>Makowe gano nimmakia nenga, kwenda Bwanali, panga manaitei nnalu'me mwu'bi'lya ai na nnyumbowe ywangau'bi'lya, na aywo nnyumbowe kayi'ki'tya tama nakwe, kaneanneke nnwawa ywo. <verse eid="1CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13"/>Nyinyonyo na nnwawa mwu'bi'lya mana ai na nsengowe ywangau'bi'lya na aywo nsengowe kayi'ki'tya tama nakwe, kaneanneke nnalu'me ywo. <verse eid="1CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14"/>Kwa mwanjaa aywo nnalu'me ywangau'bi'lya aapeleteyelwa na Nnu'ngu' kwo pi'tya nnyumbowe, nyinyonyo na nnwawa ywangau'bi'lya aapeleteyelwa na Nnu'ngu' kwo pi'tya nsengowe. Kenda ikapangageli nyo bana binu bapelepangali apeleteu, lakini mwaibile nambi'yambi' bembe apeleteu. <verse eid="1CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15"/>Lakini manaitei yu'lu' ywangau'bi'lya kapala kunneka nnyine, anneke bai, apo aywo nnwawa au nnalu'me ywau'bi'lile aapanga ayu'gu'lilwe kwa lisengele lyo. Kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' ankemike li'nga mutame mumaisa ga amani. <verse eid="1CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16"/>Muwesali tanga panga, kwo u'bi'lya kwa nnyumbowe au nsengowe, pi'ngi' yumo ywabe aawesa kunng'alambwa nnyine ywangau'bi'lya li'nga amwu'bi'li Kilisitu.<verse eid="1CO 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Utame kati mwaukemilwe na Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17"/>Lakini kila mundu atame mumaisa gagabu'kana na Bwana, galu' gaakemilwe na Nnu'ngu'. Li'no nga lilagyo lyanilibi'ka mumakanisa goti. <verse eid="1CO 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18"/>Manaitei mundu aakemilwe na Nnu'ngu' abile ainilwe, bai, kaneapange kati ywangainilwa. Kai' manaitei mundu aakemilwe na Nnu'ngu' abile ywangainilwa, bai kaneainilwe. <verse eid="1CO 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19"/>Inilwa au kotoka inilwa kili'be sa ngamali, kili'be sakibile sa ngama kwikamwa amuli ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1CO 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20"/>Bai, kila mundu atame kati mwaabile paakemilwe na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1CO 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21"/>Buli, Nnu'ngu' aakukemite nsimu pawaabile wa mmanda? Alyo kanelikuauye. Lakini mana upatike lipala lya kwibi'ka ulu, bai, utumi lipala lyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22"/>Kwa mwanjaa ywembe ywaakemilwe na Bwana abile mmanda, aywo aalu'a ba ulu kwa Bwana, nyinyonyo na ywaakemilwe abile ulu aywo nga mmanda kwa Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23"/>Mwaapi'milwe na Nnu'ngu' kwa bei, kwa nyo, kanemube mwaabanda ba bandu kai'. <verse eid="1CO 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24"/>Mwalongo bangu', kila mundu aigale na Nnu'ngu' kati mwaabile nsimu waakemilwe.<verse eid="1CO 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bu'kana na bangali kobeka na alwawa awi'li'kwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25"/>Bu'kana na alu'mi'langa nenga ntu'pu' amuli yaibu'ka kwa Bwana, lakini nibaya kati na mundu ywaniu'bi'like kwa kiya sa Bwana. <verse eid="1CO 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26"/>Bu'kana na tabu yaibile nambi'yambi', nibona male muigale kati mwamubile. <verse eid="1CO 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27"/>Manaitei ukobike bai kaneupale lekangana, na mana unakobekali bai kaneukobeke. <verse eid="1CO 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28"/>Lakini ntu'pu' sambi kwa babakobeka au ku'nda, ila babakobike au ku'nda baalu'a pata tabu mumaisa ga, na nenga nipalage kanemwipate tabu yo.<verse eid="1CO 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29"/>Lakini mwalongo bangu' nibaya nyinya, wakati wauigalile bu'ka nambi'yambi' mpaka buya kwa Kilisitu, nsene bai, kwa nyo balu' babakobike batame kati bangali kobeka li'nga bapange kasi ya Bwana, <verse eid="1CO 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30"/>na babali'la babe kati bangali li'la, na babapulaika babe kati bangali pulaika, nyinyonyo na babapi'ma, yi'lu' yabapi'mite ibe kati yabe lili, <verse eid="1CO 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31"/>na balu' babatumya mali ya dunia yi'no, babe kati baitumyali, kwa mwanjaa dunia yi'no kati mwatutangite yendapi'ta.<verse eid="1CO 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32"/>Nipala kanemube na kyukala kwa abali ya makowe ga. Nnalu'me ywangalikobeka aiauya na makowe ga Bwana, na kwa ndi'la yaku' apange li'nga Bwana anapusike. <verse eid="1CO 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33"/>Lakini nnalu'me ywakobike aiauya na makowe ga dunia, na kwa ndi'la yaku' apange li'nga ampulaise nnyumbowe, <verse eid="1CO 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34"/>na maganio gake gabaganike pabi'li'. Nnwawa ywangali ku'nda aiauya na makowe ga Bwana, li'nga apate baa mpeleteu kwa yi'ga na loo. Lakini yu'lu' ywaku'ndike, ywembe aiauya na makowe ga padunia, li'nga kumpulaisa nsengowe.<verse eid="1CO 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35"/>Nilongela makowe ga kwa pwaila yinu mwabene, kwenda nendakunkanikiyali, ila nipala mutame mundi'la ya kakape yaipalikwa, li'nga mupate kuntumikia Bwana pangali minyikia makowe gi'ngi'.<verse eid="1CO 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36"/>Nnalu'me mana aibweni ampangyali wiso mwi'nja ywapala kunkobeka, na mana kautilwa na maminyikio, apange mwapala. Bakobekane bai, wala apangali sambi. <verse eid="1CO 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37"/>Lakini mundu mana aamuite mwene bu'ka pamwoyo wake kotoka kobeka, pangali li'ndi'ndi'lwa na mundu ywoywoti, ila awesa kwitawala mwene na maminyikio gake go kotoka kunkobeka aywo nnwawa, bai apanga kati mwaipalikwa. <verse eid="1CO 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38"/>Kwa nyo, nnalu'me ywankobeka nnwawa ywapalage kunkobeka ywembe, aapanga likowe linogau, na nnalu'me ywaakotoka kobeka aapanga likowe linogau muno.<verse eid="1CO 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39"/>Nnwawa apalikwa tama na nsengowe kwa nsimu woti wa baa mwu'mi. Lakini mana nnalu'me awile, nnwawa aapanga ulu kwo ku'nda na nnalu'me ywoywoti, ila aywo nnalu'me abe mpwasi wa Bwana. <verse eid="1CO 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40"/>Manaitei aatama kisake aapanga na pulaa muno, ila aga maganio gangu', na niu'bi'lya panga, nanenga nibile na Loo wa Nnu'ngu' ywanilongoya longela go.<verse eid="1CO 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8"/>
  <para style="s">Ilyo yaibi'ki'lilwe kwa inyago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1"/>Nambi'yambi' nilongelya bu'kana na ilyo yaibi'ki'lilwe kwa inyago. Tutangite panga kila mundu abile na ilimu, lakini ilimu yo yapanga bandu baipune, ila upendo ngauliyangatia likanisa lisengelwe. <verse eid="1CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2"/>Ywagania panga atangite likowe nsi'si', anatangali likowe lyolyoti kati mwaipalikwa kulitanga. <verse eid="1CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3"/>Lakini Nnu'ngu' antangite mundu ywampenda.<verse eid="1CO 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4"/>Kwa nyo bu'kana na ilyo yaibi'ki'lilwe kwa inyago, tutangite panga inyago kili'be lili mudunia, satutangite twenga panga Nnu'ngu' yumo bai. <verse eid="1CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5"/>Ata ikatei bandu bi'ngi' bagania panga kubile na kinnu'ngu' na mabwana bi'ngi' mudunia au kunani, <verse eid="1CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6"/>lakini kwitu twenga Nnu'ngu' yumo bai, na nga Tati' ywaumbike ili'be yoti, na twenga tutama kwa kitumbu sake. Kai', kubile na Bwana yumo bai, na ywembe nga Yesu Kilisitu. Ili'be yoti yaumbilwe kwo pi'tya ywembe, kai' twenga tulama bu'kana na ywembe.<verse eid="1CO 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7"/>Lakini boti lili bababile na ilimu ya likowe li'. Kwa mwanjaa kubile na bi'ngi' babayobeli inyago, bandu bo mpaka nambi'yambi' pabalya, baibona kati balo kabalya ilyo yaibi'ki'lilwe kwa inyago. Kwa mwanjaa muimani balo banakomalali, kwa nyo baibona bapanga sambi. <verse eid="1CO 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8"/>Lakini kilyo kitubi'kali papipi na Nnu'ngu', kwa mwanjaa ata mana tukotwike lya tuobeyali kili'be, kai' ata mana tulile, tuyongekeyelwali kili'be.<verse eid="1CO 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9"/>Lakini mulinguli, wu'no uulu winu kanewaapange bangali komala muimani baku'bale. <verse eid="1CO 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10"/>Kwa mwanjaa mundu ywangalikomala muimani, mana amweni mwene ilimu yi' kalya munyumba ya inyago, buli, aawasali panga yendayi'ki'ti'lwa lya kilyo sakibi'ki'lilwe kwa inyago? <verse eid="1CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11"/>Kwa ndi'la yo aywo nnongo mwene imani yangakomala, Kilisitu ywaawile kwa kitumbu sake, aalu'a oba, bu'kana na ilimu yako. <verse eid="1CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12"/>Manaitei kamupanga sambi kwa alongo binu kwa ndi'la yi'no na kwalumiya myoyo na imani yabe yangakomala, apo munkosya muno Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13"/>Kwa nyo manaitei nyama yanilya kaimpanga muumini nnyangu' atu'mbu'ke musambi, naailyali nyama yo ata pasene, li'nga naakane kumpanga nnyangu' apange sambi.<verse eid="1CO 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9"/>
  <para style="s">Aki na lyengo lya atumilwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1"/>Buli, nenga na mundu ulu lili? Buli nantumilwe lili? Buli, nenga namwenili Yesu, Bwana witu? Buli, mwenga mauno ga lyengo lyangu' lili kwa Bwana? <verse eid="1CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2"/>Ata manaitei bandu bi'ngi' kabaibona panga nenga nantumilweli, lakini kwinu mwenga nantumilwe kwa kitumbu sa imani yinu kwa Kilisitu, ilaya panga nantumilwe wa Bwana.<verse eid="1CO 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3"/>Amo ngamwaniyangwa kwa balu' babanipekeseni. <verse eid="1CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4"/>Buli twenga ntu'pu' aki yo lya no nywa mulyengo litu lya utumilwe? <verse eid="1CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5"/>Buli tuyi'ki'ti'lwali longwana na ayumbo bitu aumini patuyabwa mwanja wo ala, kati mu'lu' atumilwe bi'ngi' na anunabe Bwana Yesu, na Petili? <verse eid="1CO 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6"/>Au nenga na Balanaba bai ngatupalikwa panga lyengo li'ngi', li'nga tukombwe pata ili'be yaipalikwa mumaisa gitu? <verse eid="1CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7"/>Asikali ywaku' ywayenda kungondo kwa kwili'pya mwene? Ywaku' ywapanda nng'unda wa minjabibu, no kotoka lya itunda yake? Na ywaku' ywasunga kipi'nga sa ngondolo ywakotoka tumya mabele gake?<verse eid="1CO 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8"/>Mayi'gi'yo ganigabaya, kwenda maganio ga bandu lili ila ata salya ya Musa kai' ibaya nyinyonyo. <verse eid="1CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9"/>Kwa mwanjaa musalya ya Musa iandikilwe, “Kaneumwibe nkano ng'ombe pali'bata ngano li'nga ku'bata.” Buli, ngo baya kakape Nnu'ngu' annongelya ng'ombe? <verse eid="1CO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10"/>Au alongelage ga kwa kitumbu situ? Kakape ngamwaibile! Maandiko ga gaandikilwe kwa twenga, kwa mwanjaa mundu pali'ma na nku'bati paku'bata, boti babile na mau'bi'lyo go pata mauno gabe. <verse eid="1CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11"/>Manaitei twapandike mbeyu ya kiloo mumyoyo yinu, buli ipalikwali twenga una ili'be yo lya yaibu'ka kwinu? <verse eid="1CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12"/>Manaitei bi'ngi' baabile na aki yo pata ili'be yo bu'ka kwinu, kakape na twenga tubile na aki muno kulikoni bi'ngi'.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Lakini twenga twalongiteli aki yi' yayapalikwe tupeyelwe na mwenga, ila twakomiye goti li'nga twaakane kwaibya bandu u'bi'lya abali inannoga ya Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13"/>Kakape mutangite panga babatumika munyumba ya Nnu'ngu' bapata liposo lyabe munyumba yo. Na balu' babapanga kasi pakibi'ki'lyo sa nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', nabembe bapokya itomwa ya nyama yo. <verse eid="1CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14"/>Nyinyonyo na Bwana aamulise panga balu' babaala Abali Inannoga bapate liposo lyabe bu'ka mumakanisa.<verse eid="1CO 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15"/>Lakini nenga mumakowe go natumyali ata limo, na kwenda niandika ga li'nga munipei lili. Kwangu' nenga, nantali niwee kulikoni mundu ywoywoti kunikanikia kwilumba kwangu'. <verse eid="1CO 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16"/>Nenga ntu'pu' aki ya kwilumba kwa kitumbu so ala Abali Inannoga, kwa mwanjaa lyengo li' nilipanga kwa amuli ya Nnu'ngu'. Kai' naakibona mana nikwotwike ala abali yo. <verse eid="1CO 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17"/>Ikapangage nialike kwo penda namwene, nilu'e banayo upo yangu', lakini nialikeli kwo penda namwene, bai apo nitimisa si'lu' sanipalikwa panga. <verse eid="1CO 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18"/>Bai upo yangu' nga yaku'? Upo yangu' nga yi'no, yo ala Abali Inannoga pangali li'pi'lwa, lombolya kotoka longa aki yaniipala mulyengo lyo.<verse eid="1CO 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19"/>Pamope no panga nenga na mmandali kwa mundu ywoywoti, lakini niipangite nammanda kwa kila mundu li'nga kwauta bandu baingi kwa Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20"/>Kwa Ayahudi naabile kati na Nnyahudi, li'nga kwauta Ayahudi. Kwa bandu balu' babaabile pai' ya Salya ya Musa, naabile pai' ya salya yi' (pamope no panga nenga nibileli pai' ya salya), li'nga kwauta balu' babaabile pai' ya salya. <verse eid="1CO 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21"/>Kwa balu' bangali baa na salya, naabile kati ywangali baa na salya, li'nga kwauta abo bababile panja ya salya. Kwenda nenga niikamwali salya ya Nnu'ngu', ila nilongoyelwa na salya ya Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22"/>Kwa akigopi naabile kati nakigopi li'nga niwese kwauta bababile akigopi. Naaipangite namundu wa sampuli mbali'mbali' kwa bandu boti li'nga kwa ndi'la yoyoti niwese kwakosopolya bi'ngi' babe.<verse eid="1CO 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23"/>Nipanga aga goti kwa kitumbu sa Abali Inannoga, li'nga nipate baa kiselele mu balaka yake. <verse eid="1CO 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24"/>Buli, mutangiteli panga pabang'anda butuka, boti bendabutuka lakini ywapata upo yo sinda yumo bai? Kwa nyo, mubutuke muno li'nga mupate upo yo sinda. <verse eid="1CO 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25"/>Kila ywabaa muming'ando aiyobeleka ng'anda kwo kasana. Nabembe bapanga nyo li'nga bapoki taji yaialabika, lakini twenga tupanga nnya li'nga tupoki taji yangaalabika milele. <verse eid="1CO 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26"/>Kwa nyo nibutuka kati mundu mwene manugio go sinda, na niku'mbwanali kati mundu ywaku'mbwa pabule. <verse eid="1CO 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27"/>Ila niiku'su'mbwa yi'ga yangu' na kwiyobeleka komeya li'nga bu'ka pa kwaalya bandu Abali Inannoga, nenga namwene naakane obeya upo yo sinda.<verse eid="1CO 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10"/>
  <para style="s">Likwi'li'ko bu'kana na inyago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1"/>Mwalongo bangu', nipala mutange panga kiu'ku'lu' bitu baayabwi mwanja kababu'ka Misili kwo longoyelwa na lyunde, kai' boti baapite pakatikati ya baali ya Shamu. <verse eid="1CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2"/>Boti baabatisilwe no panga apwasi ba Musa nkati ya li'lu' lyunde na nkati ya yi'lu' baali. <verse eid="1CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3"/>Boti baalile kilyo si'si'lu'si'lu' sa loo, <verse eid="1CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4"/>na boti baanywile kinywo simo sa kiloo, kwa mwanjaa baanywile masi' gagabu'ka nkati ya mpi'mbi' wawaalongwaniye nabo, na mpi'mbi' wo wai nga Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5"/>Lakini Nnu'ngu' aanogelilweli na baingi babe, kwa nyo ngabalangamiswa, na mitwi yabe ngaibamba mulubele.<verse eid="1CO 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6"/>Bai, makowe ga goti gaabile kagatulaya ndi'la twenga li'nga twaakane ba twabandu babaminyikia malau, kati bembe mwabaaminyikiye malau. <verse eid="1CO 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7"/>Kanemube mwabandu bo kilikitya inyago kati bi'ngi' babe mwabaabile, kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu panga, “Bandu baatitama, lya no nywa bu'kapo yi'ma no ina.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8"/>Wala kanetupange upege kati bi'ngi' babe babaapangite nyo no waa bandu elupu isilini na atatu kwa lisu'ba limo. <verse eid="1CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9"/>Kai' kanetumpaye Bwana, kati bi'ngi' babe mwabaapangite, ngabawaa kwo lumilwa na nng'ambo. <verse eid="1CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10"/>Wala kanemuku'ku'li'ke kati bi'ngi' babe mwabaapangite, ngababulagilwa na malaika mwalabiyi.<verse eid="1CO 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11"/>Makowe ga goti gaapatike bembe li'nga gabe kati mayi'gano na gaandikilwe li'nga kutukwi'li'ka twenga twatutama mumasu'ba gano ga kuundi'la. <verse eid="1CO 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12"/>Kwa nyo kila ywaibona ayi'mi wiso muimani alinguli aakane tu'mbu'ka. <verse eid="1CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13"/>Ntu'pu' lipayilwo lyolyoti lyalimpata mundu lyalibile liku'lu' pi'ta lya bandu bi'ngi'. Nnu'ngu' mwu'bi'li'ka, ywembe aalu'a kunnekali mupayilwe pi'ta uweso winu wo komeya. Ila, pamope no payilwa, Nnu'ngu' aalu'a kumpeya ndi'la yo pita mo, mubile salama.<verse eid="1CO 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14"/>Kwa nyo mwamambwiga bangu' mwamupendilwe, mwitile kwikilikitya inyago. <verse eid="1CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15"/>Nilongela na mwenga mwabandu bene malango, muamwe mwabene bu'kana na gano ganigalongela nambi'yambi'. <verse eid="1CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16"/>Patunsukulu Nnu'ngu' kwa kikombe si'lu' sa balaka, buli tubali pamope mumyai ya Kilisitu? Na patumetwa likati buli, tubali pamope muyi'ga ya Kilisitu? <verse eid="1CO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17"/>Kwa mwanjaa likati lyatumetwa twabandu boti limo, kwa nyo twenga twaboti yi'ga yimo, pamope no panga twabambone. <verse eid="1CO 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18"/>Mwalinguli Baisilaili, balu' babalya salaka yaipiyilwe pakibi'ki'lyo, balu'mbana na Nnu'ngu' kwa ndi'la ya salaka yo. <verse eid="1CO 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19"/>Bai nibaye namani? Panga kilyo si'lu' sakipiyilwe salaka kwa inyago nga kili'be sa ngama? Au panga inyago nga kili'be? <verse eid="1CO 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20"/>Lili! Lakini sanipala baya panga salaka yabapiya bandu bangali kuntanga Nnu'ngu' baapikia kimasetani, kwenda Nnu'ngu'li. Nanenga katu nipendili mwenga mulu'mbane na masetani. <verse eid="1CO 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21"/>Muwesali nywelya mukikombe sa Bwana na sa masetani kai', nyinyonyo muwesali baa pamope mukilyo pamesa ya Bwana na pamesa ya masetani. <verse eid="1CO 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22"/>Au tupala kunsokasoka Bwana abe na bwigu? Mugania tubile na makakala pi'ta ywembe?<verse eid="1CO 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kila kili'be kibu'kana na utukupu wa Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23"/>Mwabandu bi'ngi' nkati yinu mubaya, “Ili'be yoti iyi'ki'ti'yilwe,” ila yotili yaileta pwaila. Kai' “Ili'be yoti iyi'ki'ti'yilwe,” lakini ili'be yi'ngi' innetyali mundu pwaila ya kunsenga muimani. <verse eid="1CO 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24"/>Mundu ywoywoti kaneapale gagabile ga pwaila yake mwene, ila kila mundu apale galu' gagaayangatia na bi'ngi'.<verse eid="1CO 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25"/>Mulye sosoti sakipi'mi'yi'lwa pasoko. Kanemulaluyelaluye li'nga pala tanga panga yendayi'ki'ti'yi'lwa au lili lya kili'be so. <verse eid="1CO 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26"/>Kwa mwanjaa Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya, “Dunia na ili'be yoti yaibile nkati yake, nga mali ya Bwana.” <verse eid="1CO 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27"/>Mana mukokilwe kwa mundu ywangau'bi'lya, mwalyee sosoti sakibi'ki'lwa nnu'ngi' yinu pangali kunnaluya. <verse eid="1CO 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28"/>Lakini mundu mana ammakiye, “Kilyo si'no kibi'ki'lilwe muinyago,” bai kanemulye. Kwa mwanjaa ya aywo ywammakiye nyo na kwa kitumbu sa mwoyo. <verse eid="1CO 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29"/>Nilongelali bu'kana na maganio ga myoyo yinu, ila nilongelya maganio ga mwoyo wa mundu yu'lu' ywabaite. Nitangite mulu'a nilaluya, “Kwa mwanjaa namani uulu wangu' namwene uukumilwe na maganio ga mwoyo wa mundu ywi'ngi'? <verse eid="1CO 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30"/>Mana kaninsukulu Nnu'ngu' kwa kilyo sanilya, kwa ki'li' nipate lukoolo kwa kilyo saninsukulu Nnu'ngu' bu'kana na so?”<verse eid="1CO 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31"/>Bai, likowe lyolyoti lyamupanga, manaitei lya au nywa, mupange goti kwa utukupu wa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1CO 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32"/>Katu kanemupange likowe lyolyoti lyalyalu'a kwapanga bandu bi'ngi' bapange malau, ibe kwa Ayahudi au bangali Ayahudi au mundu ywoywoti mumakanisa ga Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1CO 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33"/>Mube kati nenga mwanibile. Kwa kila ndi'la nibinia kumpulaisa kila mundu mumakowe gangu' goti ganipanga. Na kwenda nipanga nyo li'nga nipate kili'be lili, ila nipanga nyo li'nga kwapanga bandu baingi bawese kosopolelwa.<verse eid="1CO 10:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1"/>Muniyige nenga kati nenga mwaninnyiga Kilisitu.<verse eid="1CO 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wi'ki'lya ntwe pamusalya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2"/>Nendakunnumba kwa kitumbu sa kuniku'mbu'kya mumakowe goti, na kugakamwa mayi'gano goti ganimpeile. <verse eid="1CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3"/>Lakini nipala mutange kai' panga Kilisitu nga ntwe wa kila nnalu'me, na ntwe wa nnwawa nga nnalu'me, na ntwe wa Kilisitu nga Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4"/>Kila nnalu'me ywalu'ba au londwa ku'no awi'ki'li ntwe wake, aywo amwisiya Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5"/>Nyinyonyo na nnwawa palu'ba au londwa pangali wi'ki'lya ntwe wake, amwisiya nsengowe, kwa kitumbu so alandana na nnwawa yu'lu' ywasekwi nywili yoti. <verse eid="1CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6"/>Manaitei nnwawa awi'ki'lyali ntwe wake, nantali atemi. Lakini yaapanga oni kwa nnwawa temya au sekwa nywili yake. Kwa nyo apalikwa awi'ki'li ntwe wake. <verse eid="1CO 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7"/>Ipwaikali kwa nnalu'me wi'ki'lya ntwe wake kwa mwanjaa ywembe alaya utukupu wa Nnu'ngu'. Lakini nnwawa alaya utukupu wa nnalu'me. <verse eid="1CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8"/>Kwa mwanjaa nnalu'me apitikeli kwa nnwawa, ila nnwawa apitike kwa nnalu'me. <verse eid="1CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9"/>Na nnalu'me aumbilweli kwa kitumbu sa nnwawa, ila nnwawa kwa kitumbu sa nnalu'me. <verse eid="1CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10"/>Kwa kitumbu sa malaika, nnwawa apalikwa wi'ki'lya ntwe wake, li'nga laya panga ai pai' ya utawala wa nsengowe. <verse eid="1CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11"/>Lakini muulu'mbani na Bwana, nnwawa kili'be lili pangali nnalu'me, na nnalu'me kili'be lili pangali nnwawa. <verse eid="1CO 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12"/>Nibaya nyo kwa mwanjaa kati mwaibile panga, nnwawa aumbilwe bu'ka kwa nnalu'me, nyinyonyo na nnalu'me abelekwi na nnwawa. Lakini kila kili'be kibu'kite kwa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1CO 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13"/>Muamwe mwabene, buli, yendapwaika nnwawa lu'ba Nnu'ngu' pangali wi'ki'lya ntwe wake? <verse eid="1CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14"/>Ata maumbile gene galaya mpu'la panga kwa nnalu'me ba na nywili ndaso oni kwake mwene, <verse eid="1CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15"/>lakini kwa nnwawa ba na nywili ndaso nga isima kasake mwene, kwa mwanjaa nnwawa apeyilwe nywili ndaso li'nga wi'ki'lya ntwe wake. <verse eid="1CO 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16"/>Manaitei mundu kapala tauka bu'kana na likowe li'no, bai atange panga twenga wala mumakanisa ga Nnu'ngu' ntu'pu' mimu yi'ngi'.<verse eid="1CO 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kalamu ya Bwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Mat 26:26-29</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Mal 14:22-25</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17"/>Nibile balo kunnagya ga, niwesali kunnumba bu'kana na aga, kwa mwanjaa kwembana kwinu mumakanisa kwenda kwa pwaila lili ila kwa bule bai. <verse eid="1CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18"/>Wi'ti' niyu'wine panga pamukwembana kati likanisa, nkati yinu mwendabaganika, nanenga mwanibona iwesa panga kakape. <verse eid="1CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19"/>Mibaganiko nkati yinu lasima ipiti, li'nga balu' babayi'ki'tilwe na Nnu'ngu' batanganikwe. <verse eid="1CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20"/>Kwa mwanjaa, pamukwembana pamope, mulyali Kalamu ya Bwana kati mwaipalikwa, <verse eid="1CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21"/>kila mundu alya kilyo sake mwene pangali kwali'nda bi'ngi', kwa nyo bi'ngi' baigala na njala na bi'ngi' bendalobya. <verse eid="1CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22"/>Buli, muwesali lya no nywa mumayumba ginu? Kwa ki'li' mulisalawa likanisa lya Nnu'ngu' na kwaisiya abo bangali kili'be? Nimmakie namani? Ninnumbe au? Lili, niwesali kunnumba ata pasene bu'kana na likowe li'.<verse eid="1CO 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23"/>Mayi'gano ganinnyi'ganiye nga gagalu'galu' ganigapokile bu'ka kwa Bwana, panga kilo si'si'lu'si'lu' saasongilwe Bwana Yesu atweti likati, <verse eid="1CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24"/>naywembe bu'ka pa kunsukulu Nnu'ngu' ngalimetwana, kabaya, “Ayi' nga yi'ga yangu' yaipiyilwe kwa mwenga, mupange nnyo kwa kuniku'mbu'kya.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25"/>Nyinyonyo bu'ka po lya, ngatola nnobo wa divai no baya, “Nnobo wu' nga lilagano lyayambi' lyalibonekana kwa ndi'la ya myai yangu'. Mupange nnya kila pamunywelya nnobo gu', kwa kuniku'mbu'kya.”<verse eid="1CO 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26"/>Ayi' ilombolya panga kila pamulya likati li'no na kuunywelya nnobo wu', muala kiwo sa Bwana mpaka paalu'a isa. <verse eid="1CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27"/>Kwa nyo, kila ywalya likati lyo au kuunywelya nnobo wo Bwana kati mwaikotoka palikwa, aapanga apangite sambi, kwa mwanjaa aisalawi yi'ga na myai ya Bwana. <verse eid="1CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28"/>Bai, ipalikwa kila mundu aipekeseni mwene, bu'kapo alye likati na kuunywelya nnobo. <verse eid="1CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29"/>Kwa mwanjaa mundu ywoywoti ywalya no nywa pangali tanga kilombolyo sa yi'ga ya Bwana, endalya no nywa ukumu yake mwene. <verse eid="1CO 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30"/>Si'no nga kitumbu sa bandu baingi nkati yinu bapanga atamwe na akigopi, na bandu bi'ngi' ata waa. <verse eid="1CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31"/>Lakini ikapangage twipekesenile wiso twabene, Nnu'ngu' alu'e tuukumu lili. <verse eid="1CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32"/>Lakini patuukumilwa na Bwana, apo twendakwi'li'ki'lwa li'nga twaakane pwatilwa pamope na bandu ba dunia. <verse eid="1CO 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33"/>Kwa nyo mwalongo bangu', pamukwembana pamope li'nga lya Kalamu ya Bwana, ipalikwa muli'ndane. <verse eid="1CO 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34"/>Manaitei mundu abile na njala, alye kasake li'nga kwembana kwinu pamope kanekunneti ukumu. Makowe gi'ngi' gagaigalile, naalu'a kugabi'ka wiso nsimu wanaalu'a isa kwinu.<verse eid="1CO 11:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12"/>
  <para style="s">Upo ya Loo Mpeleteu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1"/>Bai mwalongo bangu', kwo bu'kana na upo ya Loo Mpeleteu nipala mutange ukakape wake. <verse eid="1CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2"/>Mutangite panga pamwabile balo mwabandu bangali kuntanga Nnu'ngu', mwatikongelwa no longoyelwa kilikitya inyago yangali ukoto. <verse eid="1CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3"/>Kwa nyo mutange panga ntu'pu' mundu ywalongoyelwa na Loo wa Nnu'ngu' ywawesa baya, “Yesu akosite lasi.” Kai', ntu'pu' mundu ywawesa baya, “Yesu nga Bwana” ila kwa yu'lu' ywalongoyelwa na Loo Mpeleteu bai.<verse eid="1CO 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4"/>Kubile na upo ya kiloo ya sampuli mbali'mbali', lakini ywapiya upo yo, Loo yumo bai. <verse eid="1CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5"/>Kubile na utumisi wa sampuli mbali'mbali', lakini Bwana ywatumikiyilwa yumo bai. <verse eid="1CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6"/>Kubile na uweso wa sampuli mbali'mbali' wo panga kasi, lakini Nnu'ngu' nga yu'yu'lu'yu'lu' bai ywaapanga bandu boti bakombwe panga kasi yabe. <verse eid="1CO 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7"/>Kili'be sopeyilwe na Loo Mpeleteu, kiwesa bonekana nkati ya kila mundu, li'nga bapwailike bandu ba kanisa. <verse eid="1CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8"/>Loo yu'yu'lu'yu'lu' abile na uweso wa kumpeya mundu yumo ikima na ywi'ngi' malango. <verse eid="1CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9"/>Loo ywoywoywo ampeya mundu yumo imani, na ywi'ngi' uweso wo lawa bandu, <verse eid="1CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10"/>kai' ywoywoywo ampeya mundu uweso wo panga mangelongelo, ywi'ngi' ulondoli, ywi'ngi' kwitanga loo ya kakape na ya ubu'su', ywi'ngi' longela kwa luga yayambi' na ywi'ngi' awanikiya mwailombolya luga yo. <verse eid="1CO 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11"/>Ayo yoti kasi ya Loo Mpeleteu yumo, ywoywoywo ywampeya kila mundu upo ya sampuli mbali'mbali' kati mwapendi mwene.<verse eid="1CO 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ilu'mbi'lu'mbi' yambone, lakini yi'ga yimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12"/>Mundu ai na yi'ga yimo na nkati yake kubile ilu'mbi'lu'mbi' yambone, nyinyonyo ngamwaibile muyi'ga ya Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13"/>Kwa mwanjaa twaboti tubatisilwe ubatiso wa Loo yumo ata manaitei Ayahudi au Ayunani, wammanda au wangwana, tupeyilwe aywo Loo yumo li'nga tupange yi'ga yimo.<verse eid="1CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14"/>Yi'ga iumbilweli na kilu'mbi'lu'mbi' simo ila kwa ilu'mbi'lu'mbi' yambone. <verse eid="1CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15"/>Ikapangage lugu'lu' kalubaya, “Kwa mwanjaa nenga na luboko lili, bai, nenga na ywayi'gali,” alyo lilu'e pangali alwo lugu'lu' kanelube kilu'mbi'lu'mbi' sa yi'ga. <verse eid="1CO 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16"/>Ikapangage likutu kalibaya, “Kwa mwanjaa nenga na liyo lili, bai, nenga na ywayi'gali,” alyo lilu'e pangali alyo likutu kanelibe kilu'mbi'lu'mbi' sa yi'ga. <verse eid="1CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17"/>Ikapangage yi'ga yoti panga nga liyo, yu'wa kulu'e panga ntu'pu', nyinyonyo yi'ga yoti ikapangage likutu, nuya kulu'e panga ntu'pu'. <verse eid="1CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18"/>Lakini kati mwaibile, Nnu'ngu' akibi'kite kila kilu'mbi'lu'mbi' muyi'ga kati mwapendi mwene. <verse eid="1CO 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19"/>Kulu'ebali yi'ga, ikapangage ilu'mbi'lu'mbi' yoti panga simo bai. <verse eid="1CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20"/>Ukakape nga gu'no, yi'ga yimo lakini ilu'mbi'lu'mbi' yambone.<verse eid="1CO 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21"/>Liyo likombwali kulubakiya luboko, “Nikupalali.” Nyinyonyo, ntwe ukombwali kulubakiya lugu'lu', “Nikupalali.” <verse eid="1CO 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22"/>Lakini mwaibile, kilu'mbi'lu'mbi' sa yi'ga sakibonekana kigopi muno, aso nga sa ngama muno. <verse eid="1CO 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23"/>Kai' ilu'mbi'lu'mbi' yaibonekana panga ipalikwali isimilwa ngayatuisimu. Nyinyonyo, ilu'mbi'lu'mbi' ya yi'ga yitu yaibonekana panga ileta oni, ngayatuikota muno. <verse eid="1CO 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24"/>Ilu'mbi'lu'mbi' yangali leta oni ipalikwali kotelwa kati yi'ngi', lakini Nnu'ngu' mwene abi'kite pamope ilu'mbi'lu'mbi' ya yi'ga na kwipeya isima muno yi'lu' yaipu'ngu'kilwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25"/>Nnu'ngu' aabini panga nyo li'nga ilu'mbi'lu'mbi' ya yi'ga kaneilekangane, ila kila simo kiyangatiyane na si'ngi'. <verse eid="1CO 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26"/>Manaitei kilu'mbi'lu'mbi' simo kilumile na yi'ngi' yoti yaalu'a minya pamope naso. Na si'ngi' mana kilumbilwe, yi'ngi' yoti yaalu'a pulaika pamope.<verse eid="1CO 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27"/>Bai, mwenga mwaboti kwa pamope nga yi'ga ya Kilisitu. Na kila yumo ywinu nga kilu'mbi'lu'mbi' sa yi'ga yo. <verse eid="1CO 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28"/>Nnu'ngu' mumakanisa atumbwi wi'ti' kwabi'ka atumilwe, benebi'li' alondoli, benetatu balimu, bu'kapo bopanga mangelongelo, bene uweso wo lawa, bakwayangatiya bi'ngi', bakwalongoya bi'ngi' na bo longela luga yayambi'. <verse eid="1CO 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29"/>Buli, boti nga atumilwe, au boti nga alondoli ba Nnu'ngu'? Boti nga balimu, au boti bopanga mangelongelo? <verse eid="1CO 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30"/>Buli, bandu boti nga balawa atamwe, boti bolongela luga yayambi' au boti babaawanikiya luga yayambi'? <verse eid="1CO 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31"/>Bai, muminyikiye munomuno pata upo yaibile yangama muno. Lakini nambi'yambi' nalu'a kunnaya ndi'la yaibile ngolou muno.<verse eid="1CO 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13"/>
  <para style="s">Upendo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1"/>Ata nikalongela kwa luga ya bandu na ya malaika, mana nikotwike baa na upendo yapanga sawasawa na ndu'ti ya lilebe au liki'ngi'li' lyalikong'ondelwa pangali kitumbu. <verse eid="1CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2"/>Kai' ata mana nikalondwa no tanga ikowe yoti yaiiyilwe na malango goti, no baa na imani ngu'lu' yo amia itu'mbi', lakini mana nikotwike baa na upendo nenga na kili'be lili. <verse eid="1CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3"/>Ata nikapiya mali yangu' yoti na kwapeya aki'ba, kai' na kwipiya yi'ga yangu' itinike mwoto, mana nikotwike baa na upendo, iyangatiyali kili'be.<verse eid="1CO 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4"/>Upendo wendali'nda, wendanogeya, ntu'pu' bwigu, ntu'pu' kwipuna na ntu'pu' umbu'ku'su'. <verse eid="1CO 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5"/>Upendo ukosali isima, upalali makowe gake wene, uusikali kiyu'ngu'ya na uku'mbu'kyali malau. <verse eid="1CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6"/>Upendo upulaikyali ulau, ila upulaikya ukakape. <verse eid="1CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7"/>Upendo utotokelwali, uu'bi'lya goti, upi'kanilya goti, na ukomeya goti. <verse eid="1CO 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8"/>Upendo uyomokali. Lakini ulondoli, longela kwa luga yayambi', na malango gawesa yomoka. <verse eid="1CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9"/>Kwa mwanjaa, ulondoli wo na malango gatubile nago gatimilikeli. <verse eid="1CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10"/>Lakini pagaaisa gagatimilike, gangalitimilika gaabu'ka.<verse eid="1CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11"/>Panaabile na nnangu'ta, longela, tanga, no gania kwangu' kwabile kwa kinangu'ta. Lakini panikomile, ago goti nigalei. <verse eid="1CO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12"/>Kwa nambi'yambi' tubona kati kiwili sa kilolo kigona, lakini waisa nsimu watwalu'a bonana kuminyo. Nambi'yambi' nitangite pasene bai, lakini bu'ka pa go naalu'a tanga mpamo kila kili'be kati Nnu'ngu' mwanitangite. <verse eid="1CO 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13"/>Gano gatatu ngagagayendelya, imani, u'bi'lya na upendo, lakini sakibile sangama muno kuliko goti, nga upendo.<verse eid="1CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14"/>
  <para style="s">Upo yi'ngi' ya Loo Mpeleteu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1"/>Mwikase mube na upendo, kai' muminyikiye muno kwipata upo ya Loo Mpeleteu, na munomuno mupate upo yo ulondoli wa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1CO 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2"/>Ywalongela luga yayambi' ywembe alongelali na bandu ila na Nnu'ngu'. Naywembe alongela makowe gagaiyilwe kwa makakala ga Loo Mpeleteu. <verse eid="1CO 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3"/>Lakini yu'lu' nnondoli alongela na bandu kwa kwakangamaya muimani, kwasenga na kwali'yali'ya. <verse eid="1CO 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4"/>Yu'lu' ywalongela luga yayambi' aikangamaya imani yake mwene, lakini nnondoli aakangamaya aumini.<verse eid="1CO 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5"/>Naapendi mwaboti mube mwalongeli ba luga yayambi', lakini munomuno mube mwalondoli. Kwa mwanjaa nnondoli nga nku'lu' kulikoni ywalongela kwa luga yayambi', ila gaawanikiyilwe li'nga kwayangatia aumini bakangamale muimani. <verse eid="1CO 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6"/>Mwalongo, mana nilongei kwa luga yayambi' kasinu mwapata ki'li' mana nakotoka awanikiya? Mwatangali kili'be, ila mana nalu'a kummakia gaumukwi Nnu'ngu', au ulondoli au yi'gana au ilimu. <verse eid="1CO 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7"/>Ngamwaibile muyombo ya inwa kati pilimbi au kinanda. Mana ikotwike piya malobe mbali'mbali', mundu akombwali tanga panga uyi'mbi'lwa mwambo waku'. <verse eid="1CO 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8"/>Kai' manaitei lipenga kalili'la lilobe lyangali tanganikwa, nyai ywaalu'a kwibi'ka wiso kwa ngondo? <verse eid="1CO 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9"/>Nyinyonyo mwenga, mana mwalongela gangali tanganikwa nyai ywaakombwa tanga samukilongela? Apo, samukilongela sapanga kati nsunga bai. <verse eid="1CO 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10"/>Mudunia kubile na luga yambone muno, na ntu'pu' luga yangali maana yake. <verse eid="1CO 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11"/>Mana nikotwike tanga luga yalongela mundu ywi'ngi', nenga napanga nanng'eni kasake na ywembe nng'eni kasangu'. <verse eid="1CO 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12"/>Kwa nyo, mwamuminyikia muno kwipata upo ya Loo Mpeleteu, mukasane muno kwa kwipala upo yaikombwa kwayangatia aumini bi'ngi' bakangamale muimani. <verse eid="1CO 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13"/>Kwa nyo, ywalongela kwa luga yayambi' alu'be Nnu'ngu' li'nga akombwe awanikiya sakilongei. <verse eid="1CO 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14"/>Kwa mwanjaa panilu'ba kwa luga yayambi', loo yangu' bai ngayailu'ba lakini malango gangu' gapangali sosoti. <verse eid="1CO 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15"/>Kwa nyo nipange buli? Nilu'a lu'ba kwa loo na kwa malango, nyinyonyo nilu'a yi'mba kwa loo na kwa malango. <verse eid="1CO 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16"/>Manaitei kaulumba Nnu'ngu' kwa loo bai, popopo abile mundu ywangali tanga luga yo, akombwa baya “Amina” abile anatangali sakilongeleka? <verse eid="1CO 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17"/>Yendawesekana panga kunsukulu kwako Nnu'ngu' kwaai kunanoga, lakini inyangatiyali mundu ywi'ngi' kwikangamaya imani yake.<verse eid="1CO 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18"/>Ninsukulu Nnu'ngu' panga nilongela luga yayambi' kulikoni mwenga. <verse eid="1CO 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19"/>Lakini mulikanisa nantali nilongele mayi'gi'yo matano gagatanganikwa li'nga kwayi'gana bi'ngi', kuliko nilongele mayi'gi'yo maelupu ga luga yayambi'. <verse eid="1CO 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20"/>Mwalongo bangu' kanemuganiye kati mwaanangu'ta, ila kati mwabandu akomala. Lakini bu'kana na ulau, mube kati mwaanangu'ta. <verse eid="1CO 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21"/>Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">“Bwana alongela nnyanya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">kwo tumya longela luga yayambi'</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">na mikano ya ageni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">naalu'a longela na bandu ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">lakini ata nyo, baaniyu'wali.”<verse eid="1CO 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22"/>Kwa nyo, upo yo longela luga yayambi', nga mwanju wa makakala ga Nnu'ngu', kwa bangali u'bi'lya, lakini upo yo londwa nga mwanju kwa babau'bi'lile.<verse eid="1CO 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23"/>Kwa nyo, aumini boti ba likanisa mana bakwembine pamope na kila yumo katumbwa longela luga yayambi', bu'kapo ayingi mundu nng'eni ywangali u'bi'lya na ywangatanga, buli aabayali panga mwaboti muminya lilalu'? <verse eid="1CO 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24"/>Lakini boti mana kabalondwa, bu'kapo kayingya mundu ywangali u'bi'lya au ywangatanga, baalu'a kumpanga aibone nnau na aaukumilwa kwa kila kikowe saalu'a kiyu'wa. <verse eid="1CO 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25"/>Makowe gagaiyilwe mumwoyo gaabi'ki'lwa mpu'la na apo ngapaalu'a kwitu'ya pai' na kunkilikitya Nnu'ngu' kabaya, “Kakape Nnu'ngu' abi pamope na mwenga.”<verse eid="1CO 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndi'la inannoga ya kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu' mumakanisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26"/>Mwalongo bangu', pamukwembana pamope, mupalikwa yumo ayi'mbe, ywi'ngi' ayi'gane, ywi'ngi' agabaye gagaumukulilwe na Nnu'ngu', ywi'ngi' alongele kwa luga yayambi' na ywi'ngi' awanikiye go. Makowe ago goti, gapangika li'nga kwakangamaya aumini. <verse eid="1CO 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27"/>Mana kubile na babalongela kwa luga yayambi' kwa likanisa, babe abi'li' au atatu bai, kaneipi'ti'li'ki'ye po. Na ipalikwa balongele kwo pi'yana yumo yumo, na ywi'ngi' awanikiye si'lu' sakilongelilwe. <verse eid="1CO 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28"/>Lakini mana ntu'pu' ywo awanikiya, ywalongela kwa luga yayambi' ipalikwa atame liki. Alongele ywembe na mwoyo wake na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1CO 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29"/>Na kwa balu' alondoli babalondwa, babe abi'li' au atatu na bandu bi'ngi' bagali'nge galu' gagalongelilwe. <verse eid="1CO 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30"/>Na mana yumo nkati ya babapi'kania apeyilwe liyi'gi'yo bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu', mwaali ipalikwa akotoke. <verse eid="1CO 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31"/>Kwa mwanjaa mwaboti mwendakombwa londwa kwo pi'yana, li'nga kila mundu apate yi'ganilwa no kangamayilwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32"/>Upo ya ulondoli ipalikwa ba pai' ya utawala wa yu'lu' ywapeyilwe upo yo. <verse eid="1CO 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33"/>Kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' wa puyoli, ila wa amani. Nyinyonyo kati mwaibile mumakanisa goti ga apeleteu, <verse eid="1CO 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34"/>alwawa bapalikwali longela mulikanisa kwa mwanjaa bembe bayi'ki'tilweli, ila bayu'we kati mwaibaya salya. <verse eid="1CO 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35"/>Mana kabapala tanga likowe lyolyoti baalaluye akinasengo babe kaya, kwa mwanjaa alyo likowe nga lya oni nnwawa longela mulikanisa.<verse eid="1CO 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36"/>Mukita Liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu' liumi kasinu au limwikili mwenga bai? <verse eid="1CO 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37"/>Mundu mana aibweni panga ywembe nnondoli au ai na upo ya Loo Mpeleteu, ipalikwa atange panga ganimwandikya nga amuli yo bu'ka kwa Bwana. <verse eid="1CO 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38"/>Lakini mundu ywagasalawa makowe gano, naywembe asalaulilwe.<verse eid="1CO 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39"/>Kwa nyo mwalongo bangu', mupale muno panga mwalondoli na wala kanemwaki'li'bu'ye bandu longela kwa luga yayambi'. <verse eid="1CO 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40"/>Lakini makowe goti gapangike wisowiso kwa ndi'la inannoga.<verse eid="1CO 14:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15"/>
  <para style="s">Uyu'ki wa Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1"/>Nambi'yambi' mwalongo bangu', ninku'mbu'ki'ya Abali Inannoga yanaamwalile na yamwaipokile, na yo ngayaimpanga mube mwakangamau. <verse eid="1CO 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2"/>Kwa ndi'la ya kugakamwa maalo ga Abali Inannoga, mwendakosopolelwa, lakini mana nyo lili, u'bi'lya kwinu kwabule.<verse eid="1CO 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3"/>Naannyi'ganie mayi'gano ga ngama munomuno ganaagapokile panga, Kilisitu aawile kwa kitumbu sa masambi gitu kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu. <verse eid="1CO 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4"/>Bu'kapo, aatisikilwa no yu'yi'lwa lisu'ba lyenetatu bu'ka waa kwake, kati mwaiandikilwe mu Maandiko Mapeleteu. <verse eid="1CO 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5"/>Ampiti wi'ti' Petili, bu'kapo atumilwe bake ku'mi na abi'li'. <verse eid="1CO 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6"/>Bu'ka po aapiti kai' aumini bi'ngi' babaabile pi'ta mya tano kwa pamope, bi'ngi' babe balo bakalama, ila bi'ngi' bayomwike. <verse eid="1CO 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7"/>Ampiti Yakobi, bu'kapo na atumilwe boti, <verse eid="1CO 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8"/>na kuundi'la ya bandu boti bo, nganipitya nenga nanibile kati mundu ywaabelekwi pangali timya myei yake. <verse eid="1CO 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9"/>Kwa mwanjaa, nenga nansene muno nkati ya atumilwe na wala nipwaikali kemelwa nantumilwe, kwa mwanjaa naaliku'su'mbwi likanisa lya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1CO 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10"/>Lakini kwa ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu' nibile kati mwanibile, na ngu'ngu' yake yanipeyilwe yai yabuleli. Mwanjaa naapangite kasi kwapi'ta boti, na wala nengali ila ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu' yaibile pamope na nenga. <verse eid="1CO 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11"/>Bai, manaitei nenga au atumilwe bi'ngi' tuala maalo gaagalu'galu', kai' nga gamugau'bi'lile.<verse eid="1CO 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uyu'ki witu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12"/>Kila mundu tumwalile panga Kilisitu ayu'yi'lwe bu'ka kuuwi'li. Buli, bi'ngi' binu babaya panga awi'li baayu'kali bu'ka kuuwi'li? <verse eid="1CO 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13"/>Lakini manaitei ntu'pu' uyu'ki wa awi'li bai, ata Kilisitu nyinyonyo aayu'kiteli. <verse eid="1CO 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14"/>Na manaitei Kilisitu aayu'kiteli, bai ata maalo gitu kili'beli na imani yinu yabule. <verse eid="1CO 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15"/>Bu'ka pa go tubonekana panga twaakong'ondeli ba ubu'su' kwa Nnu'ngu', kwa mwanjaa tukong'ondeli panga Nnu'ngu' aanyu'yite Kilisitu bu'ka kuuwi'li, lakini mana awi'li baayu'yi'lwali, bai Nnu'ngu' anyu'yiteli Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16"/>Manaitei kakape awi'li bayu'kali, bai ata Kilisitu ayu'kiteli. <verse eid="1CO 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17"/>Mana Kilisitu ayu'kiteli, imani yinu ya bule na balo mubi mumasambi ginu. <verse eid="1CO 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18"/>Na ata balu' babawile kabamwu'bi'lya Kilisitu baobite. <verse eid="1CO 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19"/>Mana tumwu'bi'li Kilisitu mumaisa gano ga nambi'yambi' bai, twenga nga twabandu bo bi'ki'lwa kiya kuliko bandu boti.<verse eid="1CO 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20"/>Lakini, nga kakape panga Kilisitu ayu'yilwe bu'ka kuuwi'li na ywembe nga ntumbwo wa uyu'ki wa babawile. <verse eid="1CO 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21"/>Kati mwaibile, kiwo kiletilwe na mundu yumo, na nyinyonyo uyu'ki wa awi'li uletilwe na mundu yumo. <verse eid="1CO 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22"/>Kwa kitumbu so lu'mbana na Adamu bandu boti ipalikwa waa, na kwo lu'mbana na Kilisitu bandu boti baalu'a yu'ka bu'ka kuuwi'li. <verse eid="1CO 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23"/>Lakini kila mundu aayu'yi'lwa kwa ndi'la yake mwene, na mili'mbu' nga Kilisitu na bi'ngi' bababile bake babaayu'yi'lwa nsimu waalu'a buyangana. <verse eid="1CO 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24"/>Nsimu wa kuundi'la walu'a isa payapanga Kilisitu alangamise wi'ti' kila utawala, kila amuli, na makakala goti, bu'kapo aalu'a kwakamukiya Tati' Nnu'ngu' ukulungwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25"/>Mwanjaa ipalikwa Kilisitu atawale mpaka paalu'a kwabi'ka andumu bake boti pai' ya utawala wake. <verse eid="1CO 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26"/>Nndumu ywaalu'a langamiswa kuundi'la nga kiwo. <verse eid="1CO 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27"/>Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya, “Nnu'ngu' abi'kite ili'be yoti pai' ya magu'lu' gake.” Maandiko go gabaya panga aapeyilwe utawala wa ili'be yoti. Ila nga mpu'la panga Nnu'ngu' abalangililwali muliyi'gi'yo “yoti”, kwa mwanjaa ywembe ngaywampei utawala wa ili'be yoti Kilisitu. <verse eid="1CO 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28"/>Bai, ili'be yoti payalu'a bi'ki'lwa pai' ya utawala wake, apo naywembe Mwana mwene ngapaalu'a bi'ki'lwa pai' yake ywaabi'kite ili'be yoti, li'nga Nnu'ngu' abe ntawala wa yoti.<verse eid="1CO 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29"/>Buli, bandu bababatisilwa kwa kitumbu sa awi'li bau'bi'lya pata ki'li'? Manaitei awi'li bayu'yi'lwali ata pasene, kwa mwanjaa namani bandu babatisilwa kwa kitumbu sabe? <verse eid="1CO 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30"/>Na twenga mbona twiibi'ka mmaule masu'ba goti? <verse eid="1CO 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31"/>Mwalongo bangu', nenga nibile mmaule go waa kila lisu'ba na nga kakape kati mu'lu' mwaniipuna kwa mwanjaa, mwenga mulu'mbine na Kilisitu Yesu Bwana witu. <verse eid="1CO 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32"/>Manaitei ku'mbwana kwangu' na inyama ngali' ku'lu' Efeso kwaai kwa makowe ga mudunia bai, kulu'e nipwaika ki'li'? Mana yapanga bandu babawile baayu'yi'lwali, “Bai tulye na tunywe kwa mwanjaa tulu'a waa malau'.” <verse eid="1CO 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33"/>Kanemukongelwe, “Mayi'gi'yo ga bandu alau gaalabiya ube unannoga wa bandu.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34"/>Mutumbwe kugatumya malango ginu kati mwaipalikwa no kotoka panga sambi kwa mwanjaa bi'ngi' binu bantangiteli Nnu'ngu'. Nilongela go li'nga naaisiye.<verse eid="1CO 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yi'ga ya uyu'ki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35"/>Lakini mundu awesa laluya panga, “Babawile bayu'yi'lwa buli? Na yi'ga yabe yaalu'a ba buli?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36"/>Ago maswali ga kilogeloge, paupanda mbeyu mubwi' ilongolya wi'ti' waa, bu'kapo ngaibalika. <verse eid="1CO 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37"/>Mbeyu yoyoti yi'lu' yaupanda, ibe ngano au yi'ngi', ilandanali na ntombo wake. <verse eid="1CO 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38"/>Nnu'ngu' aipeya mbeyu ube, kati mwapendi mwene, kila mbeyu na ube wa kisake.<verse eid="1CO 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39"/>Yumbe yoti ibile na yi'ga, lakini yi'ga yo ilandanali. Bandu yakisake, inyama yakisake, iyuni yakisake, nabembe omba yi'ga yakisake. <verse eid="1CO 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40"/>Kai' kubile na yi'ga ya kunani na ya kudunia, lakini kila yi'ga ugolou wake ulandanali. <verse eid="1CO 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41"/>Ugolou wa lisu'ba ulandanali na mwei, ndondwa nayembe ugolou wake ulandanali na nyine.<verse eid="1CO 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42"/>Nyinyonyo babawile pabaalu'a yu'yi'lwa no pangilwa akoti kai'. Yi'ga “yaipandilwe” mulisiko yabola, lakini yayu'yi'lwa muukoti pangali alabika. <verse eid="1CO 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43"/>Yi'ga paisikilwa ipanga ntu'pu' isima, na ipanga na ukigopi. Lakini paiyu'yi'lwa ipanga na utukupu na makakala. <verse eid="1CO 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44"/>Pausikilwa, yi'ga ya mundu ipanga ya kibelekwe, lakini mana iyu'yilwe ipanga yi'ga yayambi' ya kiloo. Bai, mana kubile na yi'ga ya kibelekwe, kubile na yi'ga ya kiloo. <verse eid="1CO 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45"/>Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya panga, “Mundu nnongoi Adamu, aaumbilwe mwene ukoti,” Lakini Adamu wa kuundi'la, Kilisitu, nga loo ywaapeya bandu ukoti. <verse eid="1CO 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46"/>Ilongolya isa wi'ti' yi'ga ya kibelekwe bu'kapo ngaiisa yi'ga yayambi' ya kiloo. <verse eid="1CO 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47"/>Mundu nnongoi Adamu aaumbilwe kwa utu'pi' wa padunia. Mundu ywenebi'li' Kilisitu aaumi kunani. <verse eid="1CO 15:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48"/>Bandu ba padunia balandana na Adamu ywaaumbilwe kwa utu'pi', na bandu ba kunani balandana na Kilisitu ywaaumi kunani. <verse eid="1CO 15:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49"/>Kati mwatulandine na Adamu wa padunia, nyinyonyo twalu'a landana na Kilisitu ywaaumi kunani.<verse eid="1CO 15:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50"/>Mwalongo bangu', nibaya panga yi'ga na myai ikombwali yingya muukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu', na so alabika kikombwali yingya muukoti wangayomoka. <verse eid="1CO 15:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51"/>Mupi'kaniange, nimmakia makowe gagaiyilwe panga twaboti twalu'a waali, ila, twaboti twalu'a galambuyilwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52"/>Lipenga lya kuundi'la palyalu'a yulilwa yapanga kwo imukya bai kati ku'pya. Nsimu wo, babawile baalu'a yu'yi'lwa li'nga balame milele na babaalu'a panga balo kabalama nabembe baagalambuyilwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53"/>Yi'ga yaialabika ipalikwa igalambuyilwe no panga yi'ga yangali alabika, na yi'ga yaiwaa ipalikwa ipangilwe yo kotoka waa. <verse eid="1CO 15:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54"/>Yi'ga yo alabika na yo waa payalu'a galambuyilwa no panga yangali alabika na yangali waa, apo nga pagaalu'a timya Maandiko Mapeleteu gagabaya panga, “Nnu'ngu' asindike, na kiwo kisindwile.”<verse eid="1CO 15:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55"/>“Mwakiwo, sinda kwinu kubile kwaku'?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:55">Na uweso winu wo bulaga ubile kwaku'?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56"/>Makakala ga kiwo gabu'kana na sambi yatupanga, na makakala ga sambi gabu'kana na salya. <verse eid="1CO 15:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57"/>Lakini tunsukulu Nnu'ngu' ywatupeya usindi kwa ndi'la ya Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="1CO 15:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58"/>Kwa nyo mwalongo bangu', mukangamale muimani yo pangali kotoka. Muyendeli kwipanga kasi ya Bwana kwa makakala kila lisu'ba, mwanjaa mutangite panga kasi yinu kwa Bwana, yabule lili.<verse eid="1CO 15:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16"/>
  <para style="s">Nsango wa kwayangatia alongo aumini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1"/>Bu'kana na misango ya kwayangatia bandu ba Nnu'ngu', mwenga mupalikwa mupange kati mwanigaamulise makanisa ga ku Galatia. <verse eid="1CO 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2"/>Kila mundu lisu'ba lya Jumapili, apalikwa abi'ke mabi'ko gake bu'kana na mwapatike li'nga panalu'a isa kanemwapange misango. <verse eid="1CO 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3"/>Panaalu'a isa kasinu, naalu'a kwatuma bandu bamwaalu'a kwasawa, pamope na balua ya kwapanga batanganikwe li'nga bapeleke misango yinu ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1CO 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4"/>Mana yannogelelya yenda na nenga, bai twaalu'a longwana pamope.<verse eid="1CO 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mipango ya Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5"/>Naalu'a isa kasinu bu'ka po pi'tya wi'ti' Makedonia. <verse eid="1CO 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6"/>Pi'ngi' naalu'a tama na mwenga pasene bai au ata nsimu woti wa kipepwe, li'nga mwaniyabuye kwokwoti kwa naalu'a yenda. <verse eid="1CO 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7"/>Kwa nyo nipendili bonagana na mwenga kwo pi'ta bai, kwa mwanjaa nipi'kanilya isa tama kasinu kwa masu'ba gambone, mana aapenda Bwana.<verse eid="1CO 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8"/>Lakini nambi'yambi' nilu'a igala pano pa Efeso mpaka lisu'ba lya Pentekosite. <verse eid="1CO 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9"/>Nilu'a tama pano kwa mwanjaa nipatike lipala liku'lu' lyo panga kasi yaileta itunda, pamope no panga kubile na andumu bambone babanikanikiya.<verse eid="1CO 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10"/>Timoteo paalu'a isa kasinu, mwampoki li'nga aatame pangali kyukala, kwa mwanjaa ywembe apanga kasi ya Bwana kati nenga. <verse eid="1CO 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11"/>Bai kila mundu kaneansalawe, ila munyabuye mwanja wake kwa amani li'nga aise kasangu', mwanjaa nendakunnolela pamope na alongo bitu.<verse eid="1CO 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12"/>Bu'kana na nnongo witu Apolo, nannu'bite aise kasinu pamope na abo alongo, lakini akani isa nambi'yambi', ila aalu'a isa paalu'a pata lipala.<verse eid="1CO 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mayi'gi'yo ga kuundi'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13"/>Mutame minyo, muyi'me wiso muimani, mukangamale, na mube na makakala. <verse eid="1CO 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14"/>Mupange makowe goti mu upendo.<verse eid="1CO 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15"/>Bandu alongoi u'bi'lya munkoa wa Akaya baai bandu ba munyumba ya Stefana, nabembe baatikwipiya kwayangatia aumini. Kwa nyo nendakunnu'banga, <verse eid="1CO 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16"/>muyi'ki'ti longoyelwa na bandu kati ba na balu' babatumika kwo kasana pamope nabo.<verse eid="1CO 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17"/>Nendapulaika isa kwa Stefana, Fortunata na Akaiko kwa mwanjaa banipei galu' ganakosilwe kwa kitumbu so kotoka baa kwinu pano. <verse eid="1CO 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18"/>Bapulaise mwoyo wangu', kai' na mwenga. Kwa nyo, bandu kati bo mupalikwa mwisimu ugolou wabe.<verse eid="1CO 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19"/>Makanisa ga kunkoa wa Asia gendakunsalimia. Akila na Plisikila bendakunsalimia muno kwo lu'mbana na Bwana Yesu. Na likanisa lyalikwembana pamope munyumba nalyembe lyendakunsalimia. <verse eid="1CO 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20"/>Aumini boti pano bendakunsalimia. Namwenga nyinyonyo musalimiane kwo upendo wa Kilisitu.<verse eid="1CO 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21"/>Nenga na Pauli niandike salamu yi'no kwa luboko lwangu'. <verse eid="1CO 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22"/>Ywoywoti ywakotoka kumpenda Bwana akosite lasi. Maranatha, Bwana wise!<verse eid="1CO 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23"/>Ngu'ngu' ya Bwana ibe pamope na mwenga. <verse eid="1CO 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24"/>Nimpendanga mwaboti kwo lu'mbana kwitu na Kilisitu Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 16:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16"/>
</usx>
